  sequence:
  - name: Anna
    character: 25
    speakerSprite: {fileID: 792778199420499268, guid: b96f669342d0f4c4e9ef15c78ce4df9d, type: 3}
    speakerName: Anna
    content:
    - Thank you so much for helping to retrieve my rune!
    - I ended up getting lost in those woods, but when I came out, I realised I didn't
      have my rune on me!
    - There was just no way I could go in there and take it back myself.
    waitTime: 0.05
    textSpeed: 0.05
    isRight: 0
    isSpriteShowing: 0
    canSkip: 1
    autoNext: 0
  - name: Cherry
    character: 0
    speakerSprite: {fileID: -2069185945796123168, guid: 337ce6c3564cc8a4fb044661efac34b3, type: 3}
    speakerName: Cherry
    content:
    - We're happy to help, Anna!
    - If you ever need help again, just put up another quest. Us adventurers will
      be at your call!
    waitTime: 0.05
    textSpeed: 0.05
    isRight: 1
    isSpriteShowing: 1
    canSkip: 1
    autoNext: 0
  - name: Anna
    character: 25
    speakerSprite: {fileID: 792778199420499268, guid: b96f669342d0f4c4e9ef15c78ce4df9d, type: 3}
    speakerName: Anna
    content:
    - I definitely will! You've provided only such wonderful service.
    - I've passed your reward to the guild. You should be receiving it soon.
    waitTime: 0.05
    textSpeed: 0.05
    isRight: 0
    isSpriteShowing: 0
    canSkip: 1
    autoNext: 0
  - name: Damson
    character: 1
    speakerSprite: {fileID: -2733444605593320565, guid: dc0969557c4cf8f40bb757f8cb06197d, type: 3}
    speakerName: Damson
    content:
    - Thank you, Anna. It means a lot to us.
    waitTime: 0.05
    textSpeed: 0.05
    isRight: 1
    isSpriteShowing: 1
    canSkip: 1
    autoNext: 0
  - name: Anna
    character: 25
    speakerSprite: {fileID: 792778199420499268, guid: b96f669342d0f4c4e9ef15c78ce4df9d, type: 3}
    speakerName: Anna
    content:
    - Well, I best be going now.
    - Good luck on your future adventures!
    waitTime: 0.05
    textSpeed: 0.05
    isRight: 0
    isSpriteShowing: 0
    canSkip: 1
    autoNext: 0
